			"notes": "First release, for Minecraft 1.8.9 on Ornithe. Needs PolyCompose 3.0+ and Java 25; OneConfig 1.9+ is optional.\n\n- Checks every mod in `mods` for updates: on Modrinth by file hash, and on GitHub releases for mods that link their repository.\n- Mod Updates screen (PolyCompose) from a button on the title screen and pause menu: changelogs, open a mod's page, ignore a version, update one mod or all of them. Follows your GUI scale and, with OneConfig, its theme.\n- Downloads are hash-checked and must be the same mod, then swapped in when the game closes.\n- OneConfig page (Utility, or `/modupdates`) with Open, Update All and Check Again.\n- Pre-launch check for Prism Launcher, with a window to pick which updates to install before the game starts (or Quit). The in-game screen can set the command up for you.\n- Tells you when OneClient started the game, since OneClient updates mods itself, and offers to remove this mod.\n- Updates itself from this repository's releases.\n\nSetup for the pre-launch check is in the [README](https://github.com/ooTruffle/ModUpdateChecker#before-launch-prism-launcher)."
